  - evidence_type: MANUAL_CURATION
    source: MIM curation (#260)
    notes: 'Added ''DL-threonine'' as a RELATED_SYNONYM (#260): the racemate under
      the stereo-unspecified parent — the same treatment `DL-Tyrosine` gets in this
      batch, except that CHEBI:26986 is already held by this record, so it is a synonym
      rather than a new one. RELATED rather than EXACT because the racemate is narrower
      than the parent. NOT CHEBI:16857 L-threonine, which CultureMech asserts (CultureMech#276).
      CultureMech uses this surface form and label_index did not contain it, so the
      lookup missed. No new record: CHEBI:26986 is this record''s identifier, and
      in MIM the identifier IS the ontology CURIE, so a second record on it would
      be a duplicate primary key rather than added coverage.'
